{"t": 1792856425809, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "24-pots-hidden", "Finding my thrown pots was hard: the wheel prompt never shows them; after 'Look at your pots' the NEXT line said '4 m behind you, to the right' but once close it dropped the distance and the pots sat on a low plank under the HUD text (MADE list + orange hint cover the lower-left of the screen). Took a full 360 panorama to find them."]}
