{"t": 1792857510404, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "64-clock-back", "After E at the indigo door ('E sleep until morning') at 7:00 pm, the screen went dark and the clock jumped to '21 March 6:03 pm' and then kept running BACKWARDS (5:51 after 2 s, 5:21 after 5 more s) with the sky brightening to daylight. The date never advanced; it is not morning. Lamp went out; NEXT reads 'Nothing here seems strange'. Expected: 22 March, morning."]}
